---
layout: layouts/base.njk
htmlLang: en
ogLocale: en_US
title: Events — Luxury Cover Band
description: "Luxury Cover Band for weddings, corporate events, birthdays, private parties, TV shoots and international tours."
keywords: "wedding live band, corporate event band, birthday live band, private party band, TV live band"
permalink: /en/events/
---

<section class="page-hero page-hero--list">
	<div class="container container--narrow">
		<p class="page-hero__breadcrumb">
			<a href="{{ '/en/' | url }}">{{ site.shortName }}</a> <span>·</span>
			<span>Events</span>
		</p>
		<p class="page-hero__eyebrow">What kind of event?</p>
		<h1 class="page-hero__title">Events.</h1>
		<p class="page-hero__lead">From private weddings to TV shoots and international contracts, we adapt the lineup, rider and program to the format.</p>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section section--light">
	<div class="container reveal">
		<ul class="events-grid events-grid--list">
			{% for e in enContent.events %}
			<li class="event-tile">
				<a href="{{ ('/en/events/' + e.slug + '/') | url }}">
					<div class="event-tile__photo"><img src="{{ ('/assets/photos/' + e.image) | url }}" alt="{{ e.title }} — Luxury Cover Band" loading="lazy"></div>
					<div class="event-tile__body">
						<div class="event-tile__eyebrow">{{ e.eyebrow }}</div>
						<h3 class="event-tile__title">{{ e.title }}</h3>
						<p class="event-tile__text">{{ e.lead }}</p>
						<span class="event-tile__more">Learn more ›</span>
					</div>
				</a>
			</li>
			{% endfor %}
		</ul>
	</div>
</section>
